Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The tester's re-run (59902, threads 52283/85/87): the search found the
second-circle lawyer through Temo, the model's plan named Temo and no
introduction, and the server's D663 sentence said only „თემო ჩხეიძის
ასისტენტს დაველაპარაკები…" — the lawyer was never named. When the plan has one
reachable go-between and names no introduction, and this run's searches found
exactly one named person through that same go-between, the server's D739
sentence (already approved, INTRO_TARGET_SENTENCE_ON) now names them. The
plan's own introduction still wins; two people found keeps the D663 sentence.

